          "id": "t-intro-p",
          "text_component": {
            "text": "screen_view_persist wraps the UserDefaults write+flush that fires on every single screen transition (flush() calls the deprecated, main-thread-blocking UserDefaults.synchronize()) \u2014 the highest-frequency span in the app. demo_state_publish wraps the JSON serialize + atomic file write scripts/watchdog.sh reads; demo-only bookkeeping, not representative of production behavior, but it runs on the main actor so a slow write blocks the UI for real. See bd-shop-24 in workflows/.",
            "variant": "p"
          },
          "dashboard_layout_settings": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 3,
            "column_span": 12,
